WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.915
Which tool measures the length of a pencil fairly? Let us think carefully. Standard

00:00:04.915 --> 00:00:09.629
units are agreed and repeatable for everyone. The answer is a ruler. Great work!

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:14.851
Where should a centimetre measurement begin? Let us think carefully. Standard units

00:00:14.851 --> 00:00:19.986
are agreed and repeatable for everyone. The answer is the zero mark. Great work!

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:25.869
What does a standard unit have for everyone? Let us think carefully. Standard units

00:00:25.869 --> 00:00:30.872
are agreed and repeatable for everyone. The answer is same agreed size. Great work!

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:36.662
Why may two children get different handspan counts? Let us think carefully. Standard

00:00:36.662 --> 00:00:41.625
units are agreed and repeatable for everyone. The answer is different hand sizes.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.388
Great work!
